OL,3,ATheresa May 'aghast' at Burnham's EU   
OL,4,Aplans and says 'Brexit is done'        
OL,6,FFormer Prime Minister Theresa May has  
OL,7,Fwarned Andy Burnham he should "move on"
OL,8,Ffrom Brexit, telling the BBC she is    
OL,9,F"aghast" the prime minister could be   
OL,10,Fconsidering rejoining the EU.          
OL,12,FAt the Brussels summit this week the PM
OL,13,Fsaid he wanted to "brainstorm" options 
OL,14,Ffor the future relationship between    
OL,15,FBritain and the trading bloc.          
OL,17,FIn an exclusive interview with the     
OL,18,FBBC's Sunday with Laura Kuenssberg,    
OL,19,FBaroness May, who spent three years    
OL,20,Fnegotiating an EU exit deal, said:     
OL,21,F"Brexit is done. Just accept Brexit and
OL,22,Fmove on."                              
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
